:: Gabe Hang Out End Early Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
As you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> are walking along, you turn to your elder brother and tell him that, as much fun as you’ve had hanging out with him, it is time to part ways for now. You thank him for hanging out with you with a smile, though based on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s expression, he is less than grateful for the time spent.<br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Gabe",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Really? That was it?”</span> He says with a raised eyebrow, obviously unamused from your little hang out session. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You ask me to come hang out with you and THAT’S all you can muster?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> scoffs and rolls his eyes, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whatever. About what I expected. Well, have fun, I’m heading home, loser.”</span> With that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> walks off. <span style="color:LightCoral">You find your cheeks burning a little from his remarks.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Gabe" -3>>
